  "details": "If you navigate to \"Here\" and click on someone and press \"View Avatar Details\", then proceed through \"Go To Main Menu For More Options\" button. It loads the avatar preview as we all know, but upon pressing Escape on your keyboard to exit the avatar preview and then again to open the QuickMenu; the icon \"Here\" gets stuck and Quick Menu displays \"Launch Pad\" UI instead.\nI've also recorded a video where you can see it clearly.  The video: https://streamable.com/syaxw4",
